{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2022-07-06 04:00:00', 'title': 'CATHARINA HOSPITAL SELECTS HPE EZMERAL TO POWER DATA-FIRST MODERNIZATION AND IMPROVE ACCURACY AND SPEED OF DIAGNOSIS', 'text': "AMSTERDAM--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT CATHARINA HOSPITAL, THE LARGEST HOSPITAL IN THE NETHERLANDS' EINDHOVEN REGION, PROVIDING CARE FOR OVER 150,000 PATIENTS, HAS SELECTED THE HPE EZMERAL SOFTWARE PORTFOLIO TO BUILD A CLOUD-NATIVE ANALYTICS AND DATA LAKEHOUSE TO PROVIDE MORE ACCURATE DIAGNOSIS, EARLY DETECTION AND INJURY PREVENTION FOR PATIENTS. EVERY YEAR, APPROXIMATELY 40,000 PATIENTS ARE DIAGNOSED WITH HEART FAILURE IN THE NETHERLANDS. HEART"}